{"task_id": "HumanEval/161", "solution": "```python\ndef solve(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Processes a string by reversing letter case or reversing the entire string if no letters are present.\n    It returns the modified string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n    has_letters = any(char.isalpha() for char in s)\n\n    if not has_letters:\n        return s[::-1]\n    else:\n        result_chars = []\n        for char in s:\n            if char.isalpha():\n                result_chars.append(char.swapcase())\n            else:\n                result_chars.append(char)\n        return \"\".join(result_chars)\n```"}
